        }
      }
    },
    "Closed-lid lighting paused after an error, so the logo is off. Restore your light in Settings, then turn “Keep logo on with lid closed” off and on to retry.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Closed-lid lighting paused after an error, so the logo is off. Restore your light in Settings, then turn “Keep logo on with lid closed” off and on to retry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La luz con tapa cerrada se pausó tras un error, por lo que el logo está apagado. Restaura la luz en Ajustes y luego desactiva y vuelve a activar «Mantener el logo encendido con la tapa cerrada» para reintentar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’éclairage capot fermé a été suspendu après une erreur ; le logo est donc éteint. Restaurez la lumière dans Réglages, puis désactivez et réactivez « Garder le logo allumé avec le capot fermé » pour réessayer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deckelbeleuchtung nach einem Fehler pausiert; das Logo ist aus. In den Einstellungen das Licht wiederherstellen, dann „Logo bei geschlossenem Deckel eingeschaltet lassen“ aus- und einschalten."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エラーにより画面を閉じた状態の点灯が一時停止し、ロゴは消灯しています。設定でライトを復元し、「画面を閉じてもロゴを点灯」をオフにしてからオンにして再試行してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "오류로 덮개 닫힘 조명이 일시 중지되어 로고가 꺼져 있습니다. 설정에서 조명을 복원한 다음 ‘덮개를 닫아도 로고 켜기’를 껐다 켜서 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A luz com a tampa fechada foi pausada após um erro, então o logo está apagado. Restaure a luz em Ajustes e depois desative e reative “Manter logo aceso com a tampa fechada” para tentar novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合盖灯光因错误而暂停，因此徽标已熄灭。请在设置中恢复灯光，然后关闭并重新开启“合盖时保持徽标亮起”以重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合蓋燈光因錯誤而暫停，因此徽標已熄滅。請在設定中恢復燈光，然後關閉並重新開啓“合蓋時保持徽標亮起”以重試。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ไฟเมื่อปิดฝาจอหยุดชั่วคราวหลังเกิดข้อผิดพลาด โลโก้จึงดับ กู้คืนไฟในการตั้งค่า แล้วปิดและเปิด “เปิดโลโก้ค้างไว้เมื่อปิดฝาจอ” เพื่อลองใหม่"
          }
        }
      }
    },
