    "Optional: briefly overrides normal Battery behavior when charge reaches your threshold while plugged in. Does not repeat until charge drops or you unplug.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional: briefly overrides normal Battery behavior when charge reaches your threshold while plugged in. Does not repeat until charge drops or you unplug."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opcional: cambia brevemente el comportamiento normal de Batería cuando la carga alcanza el umbral mientras está conectado. No se repite hasta que baja la carga o desconectas el equipo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Facultatif : remplace brièvement le comportement normal du mode Batterie lorsque la charge atteint votre seuil sur secteur. Ne se répète pas avant une baisse de charge ou une déconnexion du secteur."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional: Überschreibt kurz das normale Akkuverhalten, wenn am Netzteil die Ladeschwelle erreicht wird. Wiederholt sich erst, wenn der Ladestand sinkt oder das Netzteil getrennt wird."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意の機能：電源接続中に設定した充電量に達すると、通常のバッテリーモードを短時間だけ上書きします。残量が下がるか電源を外すまで繰り返しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "선택 사항: 전원 연결 중 충전량이 목표에 도달하면 일반 배터리 동작을 잠시 재정의합니다. 충전량이 줄거나 전원을 분리하기 전에는 반복하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opcional: substitui brevemente o comportamento normal do modo Bateria quando a carga atinge o limite definido com o Mac conectado à energia. Só se repete após a carga cair ou você desconectar o Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选：接通电源且电量达到阈值时，短暂覆盖普通电池模式。只有在电量下降或拔下电源后才会再次触发。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可選：接通電源且電量達到閾值時，短暫覆蓋普通電池模式。只有在電量下降或拔下電源後才會再次觸發。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "เลือกใช้: เปลี่ยนการทำงานโหมดแบตเตอรี่ชั่วครู่เมื่อชาร์จถึงระดับที่ตั้งไว้ขณะเสียบปลั๊ก จะไม่ทำซ้ำจนกว่าระดับชาร์จลดลงหรือถอดปลั๊ก"
          }
        }
      }
    },
