    "Request restoration. Native handback remains unconfirmed; your saved closed-lid choice stays paused.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Request restoration. Native handback remains unconfirmed; your saved closed-lid choice stays paused."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solicita la restauración. Aún no se ha confirmado la devolución del control a macOS; la opción guardada de tapa cerrada sigue en pausa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demandez la restauration. Le retour du contrôle à macOS n’est pas confirmé ; votre choix enregistré pour le capot fermé reste en pause."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wiederherstellung anfordern. Die Rückgabe an macOS ist unbestätigt; die gespeicherte Deckeloption bleibt pausiert."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "復元を要求します。システムへの制御返却は未確認のため、保存した閉じた画面での点灯設定は一時停止のままです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "복원을 요청합니다. 시스템으로의 제어 반환이 확인되지 않아 저장된 덮개 닫힘 설정은 일시 중지된 상태로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solicite a restauração. A devolução do controle ao macOS ainda não foi confirmada; sua opção salva para a tampa fechada continua pausada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请求恢复。尚未确认已交还原生控制权；保存的合盖设置仍保持暂停。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求恢復。尚未確認已交還原生控制權；保存的合蓋設定仍保持暫停。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ขอกู้คืน ยังยืนยันการคืนการควบคุมให้ระบบไม่ได้ การตั้งค่าเมื่อปิดฝาจอที่บันทึกไว้จึงยังหยุดชั่วคราว"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requires Input Monitoring. Uses timing only; no characters are read or saved. Secure Input can pause this response.": {
      "comment": "Backlit interface text. Keep product names and technical identifiers unchanged.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requires Input Monitoring. Uses timing only; no characters are read or saved. Secure Input can pause this response."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requiere Monitorización de entrada. Solo utiliza los tiempos de pulsación; no lee ni guarda caracteres. La entrada segura puede pausar esta respuesta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nécessite Surveillance de l’entrée. Utilise uniquement le rythme de frappe ; aucun caractère n’est lu ni sauvegardé. La saisie sécurisée peut suspendre cette réponse."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erfordert Eingabeüberwachung. Verwendet nur Zeitpunkte; keine Zeichen werden gelesen oder gespeichert. Sichere Eingabe kann diese Reaktion pausieren."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "入力監視の権限が必要です。入力のタイミングのみを使用し、文字は読み取りも保存もしません。セキュア入力により反応が一時停止する場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "입력 모니터링 권한이 필요합니다. 타이밍만 사용하며 문자를 읽거나 저장하지 않습니다. 보안 입력으로 반응이 일시 중지될 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requer Monitoramento de Entrada. Usa apenas o tempo das teclas; nenhum caractere é lido ou salvo. A Entrada Segura pode pausar essa resposta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要“输入监控”权限。仅使用时间信息，不读取或保存字符。“安全输入”可能暂停此响应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要“輸入監控”權限。僅使用時間資訊，不讀取或保存字符。“安全輸入”可能暫停此響應。"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ต้องมีสิทธิ์การตรวจดูอินพุต ใช้เฉพาะจังหวะเวลา ไม่อ่านหรือบันทึกตัวอักษร การป้อนข้อมูลอย่างปลอดภัยอาจหยุดการตอบสนองนี้ชั่วคราว"
          }
        }
      }
    },
